{"id":"n29750-3-6","stage":1,"title":"얼마 · 多少、没多少","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n29750-3-6-1","ko":"제주도까지 비행기 표가 비싸요?","zh":"去济州岛的机票很贵吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"제주도까지","meaning":"济州岛","explanation":"제주도：济州岛；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"제주도까지","audio":"/audio/9718651d3dfc78c05f1d.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제주도까지","audio":"/audio/9718651d3dfc78c05f1d.mp3"}},{"text":"비행기","meaning":"飞机","explanation":"비행기：飞机。","readings":[{"term":"비행기","audio":"/audio/3cb2c44c3b680b229e91.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15679","senseId":"1","lemma":"비행기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비행기","audio":"/audio/3cb2c44c3b680b229e91.mp3"}},{"text":"표가","meaning":"票，券","explanation":"표：票，券；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"표","audio":"/audio/40ec1a2864faf2b46f95.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71353","senseId":"1","lemma":"표","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"표가","audio":"/audio/73ea982ce2ce953dad89.mp3"}},{"text":"비싸요?","meaning":"贵","explanation":"비싸다：贵；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"비싸다","audio":"/audio/063c1a7bb93233dcd205.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66318","senseId":"1","lemma":"비싸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비싸요","audio":"/audio/a54e323c34aadb10b3f4.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3cb2c44c3b680b22","term":"비행기","zh":"飞机","audio":"/audio/3cb2c44c3b680b229e91.mp3","entryId":"15679","definition":"载着人或东西在空中飞行的交通工具。","pronunciation":["비행기"]},{"id":"40ec1a2864faf2b4","term":"표","zh":"票，券","audio":"/audio/40ec1a2864faf2b46f95.mp3","entryId":"71353","definition":"证明具有某种权利的纸条。","pronunciation":["표"]},{"id":"063c1a7bb93233dc","term":"비싸다","zh":"贵","audio":"/audio/063c1a7bb93233dcd205.mp3","entryId":"66318","definition":"物品的价格或做某事所花的费用高于一般水平。","pronunciation":["비싸다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3926f31be893585b8dba.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n29750-3-6-2","ko":"요즘은 비수기라 얼마 안 해요.","zh":"最近是